                ```

entries.en:
How many goods are on the rack now. Only while the robot stands in front of the rack, facing it; otherwise an `IllegalStateException`: stock is found out by going to look.

```
Shelf shelf = robot.getShelf();
if (shelf != null && shelf.getCount() < 2) {
    print("Time to order " + shelf.getProduct());
}
```

entries.ptBR:
Quantos produtos há na prateleira agora. Só funciona quando o robô está diante dela, voltado para ela; caso contrário, lança `IllegalStateException`: para descobrir o estoque, é preciso ir conferir.

```
                Shelf shelf = robot.getShelf();
                if (shelf != null && shelf.getCount() < 2) {
                    print("Time to order " + shelf.getProduct());
                }
                ```

entries.en:
How many goods fit on the rack when it's full. Subtract `getCount()` and you get how many are missing.

