How many items the order has in all, every product together: 1 to 3.

```
Order order = robot.takeOrder();
if (order != null) {
    print("The customer wants " + order.getTotal() + " items");
}
```

entries.ptBR:
Quantos itens há no pedido ao todo, somando todos os produtos: de 1 a 3.

```
                Order order = robot.takeOrder();
